<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>入門指南 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><description>Recent content in 入門指南 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>白水晶功效與淨化：石英入門保養指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;白水晶（Clear Quartz）是無色透明至乳白色的石英。&lt;/strong&gt;「放大能量」「淨化」是水晶文化中的象徵說法，與物理清潔是兩件事。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黃水晶功效：左右手、五行與選購保養指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%83%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%B7%A6%E5%8F%B3%E6%89%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%87%E9%81%B8%E8%B3%BC%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%83%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%B7%A6%E5%8F%B3%E6%89%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%87%E9%81%B8%E8%B3%BC%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;黃水晶（Citrine）是黃色至橘色的石英。&lt;/strong&gt;「招財」「提升自信」是水晶文化中的象徵，沒有證據保證佩戴後財運或健康會改變。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黑曜石功效與禁忌：火山玻璃的使用指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E6%9B%9C%E7%9F%B3%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E7%A6%81%E5%BF%8C%E7%81%AB%E5%B1%B1%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E6%9B%9C%E7%9F%B3%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E7%A6%81%E5%BF%8C%E7%81%AB%E5%B1%B1%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;黑曜石（Obsidian）是天然火山玻璃。&lt;/strong&gt;「擋煞」「防護」是文化與個人儀式中的說法，不能當成可驗證的物理或醫療功效。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶功效：左右手、愛情、五行與助眠說法整理</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在水晶店走了一圈，最後手裡還是捧著一顆紫水晶——你不孤單，幾乎每個人的起點都在這裡。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>